      "date": "2026-06-09T11:40:00.000Z",
      "title": "Nova Iron and Steel Limited Announces Resignation of Kusum Naruka as Independent Director, Member of Audit Committee, Nomination & Remuneration Committee, and Stakeholders Relationship Committee, Effective June 3, 2026",
      "body": "Nova Iron and Steel Limited informed that Ms. Kusum Naruka (DIN: 10679553), Independent Director of the Company, resigned from the Board of the Company with immediate effect on June 3, 2026, vide her resignation letter dated June 3, 2026, on account of professional commitments. Consequently, she ceased to be member of Audit Committee, Nomination & Remuneration Committee, and Stakeholders Relationship Committee. Ms. Kusum Naruka is also a director in Marble Finvest Limited and a member of the Audit Committee, Nomination & Remuneration Committee, and Stakeholders Relationship Committee of Marble Finvest Limited.",
